252
00:16:59,460 --> 00:17:00,989
I told you I'm in the air.

253
00:17:02,600 --> 00:17:04,580
The air over what, exactly?

254
00:17:04,900 --> 00:17:08,400
Well, I can see the land of
Wano from here, if that helps.

255
00:17:09,820 --> 00:17:11,600
Don't do anything unnecessary.

256
00:17:18,140 --> 00:17:20,060
I understand, boss.

257
00:17:20,580 --> 00:17:22,020
You bet I do.
